575
00:19:00,520 --> 00:19:01,120
Mom!

576
00:19:01,360 --> 00:19:02,680
Don't call me Mom.

577
00:19:03,040 --> 00:19:05,370
I don't have such a disobedient daughter.

578
00:19:06,040 --> 00:19:08,320
How much more obedient can I be?

579
00:19:09,320 --> 00:19:10,200
I've listened to you

580
00:19:10,200 --> 00:19:11,960
about everything all these years.

581
00:19:11,960 --> 00:19:14,040
But being a prosecutor is the one thing

582
00:19:14,040 --> 00:19:15,760
I can't compromise on.

583
00:19:16,360 --> 00:19:18,200
I really love this profession.

584
00:19:18,840 --> 00:19:20,640
It gives me a sense of worth.

585
00:19:20,640 --> 00:19:22,040
Can you understand that?

586
00:19:22,160 --> 00:19:24,240
Mom, can you put yourself in my shoes?

587
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:24,720
Just...

588
00:19:26,600 --> 00:19:28,240
just be considerate of me this once.

589
00:19:28,240 --> 00:19:29,760
I'm begging you.

590
00:19:30,400 --> 00:19:32,800
You're getting more unreasonable
as you grow older.

591
00:19:32,800 --> 00:19:34,660
You think you're all grown up now.

592
00:19:36,240 --> 00:19:36,800
Tell me.

593
00:19:38,040 --> 00:19:39,200
Are you resigning

594
00:19:39,640 --> 00:19:40,760
or not?
